  "rules_notes": [
    "The exact resulting exile incarnation returns tapped under its owner, independently of source lifetime. Instruction-level tapped entry survives departure and entry choices and uses the ordinary entry replacement machinery, never a later tap event.",
    "Equipment subtype, not creature or artifact card type, qualifies the controlled permanent entry. Existing SubtypeEntersYou includes the source only if it actually has that subtype.",
    "ReturnLinkView exposes tapped=true while an immediate return is suspended; false is omitted for unchanged existing return packets. This is a real observation payload extension with wire144, not a schema bump for an admission flag."
